'' 'iif( c, *pa, *pb )' over ZSTRING POINTERS is a string: an unsized zstring was taken for a
'' scalar arm and the statement declined (fbc's expressions/iif.bas). Expected output is fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc tests/codegen/src/iif-zstr-deref.bas -o tests/codegen/iifzstrderef.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/win64-msvc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/iifzstrderef.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 1234
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 5678
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  0            -1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 7B
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 12345678       8
